s","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_102112.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19438771/test_pr_102112.zip)\r\n\r\nNote that since <kbd>Space</kbd> opens dropdowns, you can't enter the name of an option that contains a space without having it open the dropdown.\r\n\r\nThe issue @KoBeWi noted is also present: If multiple entries start with the same word, typing the word will cycle between entries instead of \"silently\" narrowing the search until you type a letter that differentiates it from the other entries in the list. In this example, you have to press <kbd>F</kbd> twice to select `French (Canada)`, but I'd expect to have to type `French (C` instead.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09fd5523-da8f-4535-b7c7-ac2a512ee1d4","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102112#pullrequestreview-2711797990","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102112","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102112#pullrequestreview-2711797990"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102112"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-24T22:17:35Z","commit_id":"349b22c2292a4c205b1a99f78c3c7730517a5f81"}]